WEBVTT

01:40.800 --> 01:43.320
FENGYI PALACE

01:43.400 --> 01:44.360
A lot has been going on
in the palace today.

01:44.440 --> 01:47.240
I heard you're suffering from a headache.

01:51.560 --> 01:54.920
These pearls were nurtured
beneath the ice in the coldest regions.

01:55.000 --> 01:55.960
They are the most nourishing.

01:56.040 --> 01:59.720
I hope this string of pearls
can alleviate Your Highness's pain.

02:03.760 --> 02:04.600
You may leave.

02:12.120 --> 02:14.400
I appreciate your kind gesture.

02:15.760 --> 02:18.760
But my pain is a chronic ailment.

02:18.840 --> 02:20.280
The imperial physician said

02:21.560 --> 02:23.640
that curing a chronic illness
requires patience.

02:25.120 --> 02:28.960
The death of Prince Jing
is also a chronic illness for Luomei.

02:29.040 --> 02:32.000
You need to give her some more time.

02:33.760 --> 02:35.000
Your Highness,

02:35.080 --> 02:37.640
since it's a chronic illness,
it should be eradicated.

02:39.320 --> 02:40.280
Your Highness, you know

02:40.360 --> 02:42.960
the military power of the Pingnan Army
is a reliance for the Yin family,

02:43.520 --> 02:45.880
but for Luomei, it is a burden.

02:46.680 --> 02:47.800
One day, she will remove

02:47.880 --> 02:50.200
this burden for the sake
of her husband's family.

02:50.280 --> 02:52.160
Your Highness, you have no son.

02:52.240 --> 02:54.920
What will you do in the palace by then?

02:55.000 --> 02:57.080
The royal family most dreads
the relatives by marriage taking power.

02:58.520 --> 03:01.920
How can I believe that you
will treat the Yin family favorably

03:02.000 --> 03:03.280
after you ascend to power?

03:05.680 --> 03:07.600
My feelings for Luomei are obvious to all.

03:07.680 --> 03:09.520
If you're willing to help me,

03:09.600 --> 03:11.440
her heart will eventually belong to me.

03:13.720 --> 03:15.320
If I do not strive for it now,

03:15.960 --> 03:18.880
I'm afraid I will regret it
for the rest of my life.

03:22.520 --> 03:24.320
It's said that dried Tianjing Grass

03:24.400 --> 03:25.760
is more delicious when cooked.

03:27.200 --> 03:28.240
Can we wait for it to dry?

03:29.360 --> 03:31.160
With such weather,
it will become dry in three or four days.

03:33.040 --> 03:35.200
Brother, it's my turn.

03:35.280 --> 03:36.960
Brother, it's my turn.

03:37.040 --> 03:39.080
It's my turn.

03:39.160 --> 03:42.160
Brother, it's my turn.

03:44.120 --> 03:46.240
Erniu, come down.
Let your sister play for a while.

03:46.320 --> 03:47.800
No!

03:48.600 --> 03:49.480
Erniu,

03:49.560 --> 03:50.600
as a man, you should give in
to your sister.

03:50.680 --> 03:51.520
No.

03:55.960 --> 03:56.800
Erya,

03:58.160 --> 03:59.160
come.

04:07.240 --> 04:08.520
The wheat is fragrant.

04:08.600 --> 04:11.000
Tianjing Grass fills the storehouse.

04:11.080 --> 04:12.520
The wheat is fragrant.

04:12.600 --> 04:15.200
Tianjing Grass fills the storehouse.

04:18.040 --> 04:18.959
You have a dirty face.

04:19.920 --> 04:20.760
Don't run.

04:20.839 --> 04:23.200
- Run!
- Erya! Run!

04:27.960 --> 04:29.120
Don't run.

04:51.880 --> 04:53.040
You've got something on your face.

04:54.360 --> 04:55.920
- What is it?
- Here.

05:00.120 --> 05:01.240
You are laughing.

05:05.120 --> 05:05.960
Come over.

05:09.080 --> 05:10.160
Don't run.

05:10.240 --> 05:11.840
- The ground is covered with mud.
- Stop!

05:11.920 --> 05:13.080
Don't chase me.

05:13.160 --> 05:14.160
Don't chase me.

05:27.560 --> 05:29.680
When you were little,
you must have been very naughty.

05:31.680 --> 05:33.120
I wasn't just very naughty.

05:33.800 --> 05:35.000
I was good at fighting.

05:36.000 --> 05:38.080
I once knocked out two teeth

05:38.160 --> 05:39.840
of the fat boy who lived next door to us.

05:39.920 --> 05:41.320
I was only eight at that time.

05:42.120 --> 05:43.040
Why?

05:43.120 --> 05:44.840
He scared my mother with a dead mouse.

05:45.480 --> 05:47.040
Later, when my mother found out
that I had beaten him,

05:47.120 --> 05:48.800
she chased me to beat me for a day.

05:51.360 --> 05:52.320
It seems

05:52.400 --> 05:55.160
that the only person
who could discipline you is your mother.

05:56.600 --> 05:59.040
Actually, my mother
never really hit me hard.

05:59.120 --> 06:01.360
She just put on a show to scare me.

06:02.160 --> 06:04.480
I guess all mothers are the same.

06:05.920 --> 06:07.160
That's not true.

06:08.440 --> 06:09.880
Every time my mother
used the paddle on me,

06:09.960 --> 06:10.800
she really meant it.

06:10.880 --> 06:13.240
One time, she nearly crippled me.

06:13.320 --> 06:15.800
You must have made
an unforgivable grave mistake.

06:16.440 --> 06:17.360
I just skipped school.

06:18.200 --> 06:19.520
When I was a child, I disliked studying.

06:19.600 --> 06:22.000
Once, I drugged my teacher
at the school with a sedative,

06:22.080 --> 06:23.680
knocking him unconscious for two days.

06:24.280 --> 06:26.640
When my mother found out,
she gave me a severe punishment.

06:26.720 --> 06:28.080
You deserved to be beaten.

06:29.840 --> 06:31.680
You say you disliked studying.

06:31.760 --> 06:34.040
But I found you are good
at calligraphy and painting.

06:39.520 --> 06:42.840
My mother hoped that I could learn
more poetry and etiquette

06:43.440 --> 06:45.000
and become more composed.

06:45.720 --> 06:48.040
But I have always aspired to be a general.

06:48.720 --> 06:50.360
So, I didn't have much time to sit down

06:51.080 --> 06:53.040
and write or recite books.

06:56.400 --> 06:58.000
After the great fire in Qingzhou,

06:59.040 --> 06:59.880
I became a cripple.

07:01.000 --> 07:03.920
All day long, I was either
in the wheelchair or on the bed.

07:04.960 --> 07:06.120
At that time,

07:06.200 --> 07:08.920
besides painting, I played Go.

07:10.040 --> 07:11.120
I didn't expect

07:12.120 --> 07:14.200
I fulfilled my mother's wish in the end.

07:16.320 --> 07:18.520
If Her Majesty had known it,

07:19.640 --> 07:21.520
she would feel very sorry.

07:23.280 --> 07:24.120
What about you?

07:24.760 --> 07:26.080
Given your temperament,

07:26.160 --> 07:28.440
I doubt you could stay
in the fruit cake shop for long.

07:31.560 --> 07:32.520
Of course, I couldn't.

07:34.160 --> 07:35.600
But every day,

07:35.680 --> 07:38.080
I just loved to sit there,
watching my mother making fruit cakes.

07:38.920 --> 07:40.320
You were craving the fruit cakes, right?

07:40.400 --> 07:41.720
Of course.

07:41.800 --> 07:43.440
Whenever my mother made fruit cakes,

07:43.520 --> 07:44.880
she always saved the ones
with the most filling for me.

07:46.480 --> 07:47.840
Your mother treated you so well.

07:48.680 --> 07:50.960
No wonder
you just want to get a live-in husband.

08:08.880 --> 08:10.560
If the Qingzhou fire hadn't happened,

08:11.320 --> 08:12.160
what would happen

08:13.360 --> 08:14.480
if I met you?

08:21.400 --> 08:23.920
Luomei, you are a general of Great Yan.

08:24.480 --> 08:27.000
What you shoulder
is different from others.

08:27.920 --> 08:29.440
You shouldn't continue to grieve
and be dejected

08:29.520 --> 08:30.800
over someone who has passed away.

08:32.039 --> 08:33.080
Don't worry, Aunt.

08:33.840 --> 08:35.919
Tomorrow, I'll return to
the training ground to drill the troops,

08:36.000 --> 08:36.840
and I will not be negligent.

08:37.880 --> 08:38.720
Well…

08:40.799 --> 08:43.120
You know I'm not talking
about military affairs,

08:43.720 --> 08:45.120
but rather your marriage.

08:47.560 --> 08:50.720
You just said you came here today
to pray and relax.

08:51.840 --> 08:53.600
A Buddhist temple is a place
of peace and quiet,

08:53.680 --> 08:55.600
and it's not suitable to discuss
such worldly matters here.

09:01.560 --> 09:02.640
I'm tired.

09:03.320 --> 09:04.600
Let's go to the side hall to have a rest.

09:12.520 --> 09:13.920
Wan'an Hall?

09:14.000 --> 09:17.600
I don't know when
this Wan'an Hall was built here.

09:18.840 --> 09:20.240
Let's go take a look.

09:40.480 --> 09:41.440
Luomei,

09:42.080 --> 09:44.600
today's military report informed me
that you led only a dozen light cavalry

09:44.680 --> 09:46.680
to launch a sneak attack
on the enemy's scout camp at night.

09:47.280 --> 09:49.320
My heart sank
as if falling into an ice cave

09:49.840 --> 09:51.120
and then burned
as if doused with fire oil.

09:51.760 --> 09:53.840
I keep thinking of how you are
diligently engaged in your duties,

09:53.920 --> 09:55.000
both day and night.

09:55.560 --> 09:59.360
Luomei, learning that you would soon
return to the capital with your troops

09:59.440 --> 10:01.400
filled me with joy.

10:01.480 --> 10:04.200
However, yesterday, I heard
that my father was worried

10:04.280 --> 10:05.680
about the unrest in Baiyue
and has already sent an urgent decree,

10:05.760 --> 10:07.400
ordering you to divert
and pacify the disturbance.

10:07.480 --> 10:08.920
This means it will be

10:09.000 --> 10:11.520
several more months
before I can see you again.

10:12.920 --> 10:13.760
General,

10:13.840 --> 10:16.440
this Wan'an Hall was built
by His Highness for one person.

10:16.520 --> 10:20.320
The deities enshrined inside are all
to ensure the safety of that one person.

10:20.400 --> 10:22.760
Apart from His Highness,
there are no other worshippers.

10:33.880 --> 10:35.640
HOPING TO ENSURE LUOMEI'S
SAFE AND UNOBSTRUCTED JOURNEY

10:36.280 --> 10:37.120
Luomei,

10:39.080 --> 10:40.920
going to battle for our country
is your heartfelt wish.

10:41.640 --> 10:43.320
I cannot ride alongside you

10:44.040 --> 10:45.480
nor guarantee

10:45.560 --> 10:48.080
that there will be no wars or injuries.

11:10.120 --> 11:10.960
I beseech the gods and Buddhas.

11:12.160 --> 11:15.640
Yin Luomei cares for the people
and disregards her own safety.

11:15.720 --> 11:17.520
I don't ask for much.

11:17.600 --> 11:20.360
I spent the night copying scriptures
to accumulate blessings,

11:21.320 --> 11:23.280
hoping to ensure Luomei's
safe and unobstructed journey

11:23.920 --> 11:25.200
and peace in all matters.

11:38.560 --> 11:40.480
Since your first battle,

11:40.560 --> 11:42.200
the Crown Prince has been praying
for your safety,

11:42.880 --> 11:44.280
and this practice has never ceased
over the years.

11:46.920 --> 11:49.720
It seems I misjudged the Crown Prince,

11:49.800 --> 11:52.040
mistaking his genuine concern

11:52.120 --> 11:53.960
for a desire for military power.

11:56.440 --> 11:59.080
I believe in His Highness'
genuine concern.

12:01.960 --> 12:03.480
Now that you believe in it,

12:03.560 --> 12:05.080
you should agree to this marriage.

12:07.880 --> 12:08.960
I've told you

12:09.040 --> 12:12.080
that in the imperial family,
there is no love, only favor.

12:13.880 --> 12:15.920
But the Crown Prince truly
cares about you,

12:16.520 --> 12:18.280
which makes it
a really good marriage for you.

12:19.640 --> 12:20.600
His Highness is very nice.

12:22.520 --> 12:24.400
I just haven't made up my mind.

12:26.320 --> 12:28.040
If Prince Jing were still alive,

12:28.600 --> 12:29.720
I would never force you.

12:31.280 --> 12:33.040
But the imperial edict for
the arranged marriage has been issued.

12:34.880 --> 12:37.280
You have to get married anyway.

12:39.800 --> 12:42.720
If you cannot be with the one you love,

12:42.800 --> 12:44.320
just find a man

12:44.400 --> 12:47.080
who truly loves and protects you.

12:48.240 --> 12:50.040
Giving the man around you a chance

12:50.640 --> 12:52.920
means giving yourself a chance.

13:06.080 --> 13:11.320
PRAYER FOR BLESSINGS
IN THE 20TH YEAR OF ZHAOMING

13:28.800 --> 13:30.080
Let her be alone and think about it.

13:33.080 --> 13:34.280
Thank you for your help, Your Highness.

13:35.960 --> 13:38.480
Your Highness,
please remember your promise.

14:02.520 --> 14:05.880
WAN'AN HALL

14:39.120 --> 14:39.960
Your Highness,

14:43.040 --> 14:43.880
when did you arrive?

14:44.760 --> 14:46.840
I saw you were inside
and didn't want to disturb you.

14:46.920 --> 14:47.840
So, I've been waiting here.

14:49.840 --> 14:51.160
So, you have done so much for me,
Your Highness.

14:55.480 --> 14:57.560
But I am unable
to give you the same in return.

14:58.680 --> 14:59.600
Do you know
that my father wants to reclaim

14:59.680 --> 15:01.640
the Yin family's military power
through your marriage?

15:03.160 --> 15:04.000
If you are willing to marry me,

15:04.080 --> 15:06.800
I will do my best to protect
the Yin family for you and your aunt.

15:06.880 --> 15:08.760
But if I were to use your genuine feelings

15:08.840 --> 15:10.160
to protect the Yin family,

15:11.240 --> 15:12.400
that would be unfair to you.

15:15.560 --> 15:16.840
Luomei, I…

15:24.640 --> 15:25.480
It doesn't matter.

15:29.400 --> 15:30.520
You don't have to agree now.

15:31.520 --> 15:32.760
But I hope you can remember

15:35.480 --> 15:38.400
that what I said to you forever counts.

15:59.240 --> 16:03.480
WAN'AN HALL

16:05.680 --> 16:06.720
May the gods and Buddhas witness

16:07.360 --> 16:10.080
that I built this temple
with no selfish intentions.

16:11.120 --> 16:14.800
But as a mortal,
I have ultimately given in to greed,

16:16.120 --> 16:18.400
desiring to keep my beloved by my side.

16:20.600 --> 16:21.960
If my wishes come true,

16:22.560 --> 16:26.240
even if I were to fall
into eternal hell after death,

16:27.360 --> 16:28.800
I would accept it with contentment.

16:52.960 --> 16:53.800
General,

16:54.320 --> 16:55.600
the Crown Prince sent these to you

16:55.680 --> 16:56.880
to congratulate you
on returning to the capital.

17:06.839 --> 17:08.480
The best place to watch it has shifted.

17:08.560 --> 17:10.040
In this world, everything changes.

17:10.720 --> 17:12.319
Clinging to childhood memories

17:12.400 --> 17:14.200
will make you miss even better sights.

17:22.359 --> 17:23.640
I've never forgotten your ambition.

17:23.720 --> 17:25.359
Even if you become the Empress,

17:25.440 --> 17:26.520
the military power will remain yours.

17:27.119 --> 17:28.440
You'll still be General Yin,

17:29.120 --> 17:30.920
and I'll never confine you to the harem.

17:40.680 --> 17:42.600
The legend about the red foxes
in Lushan is true.

17:44.360 --> 17:45.840
As long as I, Murong Xuanlie, am alive,

17:45.920 --> 17:49.160
I won't let anything upset you.

18:02.080 --> 18:04.200
Good boy. You're so well-behaved.

18:04.800 --> 18:05.640
Tasty.

18:05.720 --> 18:07.720
I'll give you more
since you are so obedient.

18:08.400 --> 18:10.040
- Is it tasty?
- Tasty.

18:10.760 --> 18:12.880
I'll give you more if you are obedient.

18:14.120 --> 18:15.920
Okay. You'll get more later.

18:19.200 --> 18:20.600
How much longer does he
have to take this medicine?

18:20.680 --> 18:21.600
It's hard to tell.

18:22.200 --> 18:25.040
Based on the current condition,
it'll be at least ten days.

18:27.080 --> 18:28.120
Make him sober as soon as possible

18:28.200 --> 18:29.400
as long as the medicine doesn't kill him.

18:29.480 --> 18:31.600
Each day Prince Jing remains outside
is another day of danger for him.

18:32.200 --> 18:34.160
Don't worry. I understand.

19:10.520 --> 19:13.320
My Lord, it'll take ten more days
to cure Li Qing.

19:17.760 --> 19:18.600
Mei,

19:19.600 --> 19:22.040
Qingyan said Li Qing would be cured
in ten days.

19:22.920 --> 19:23.920
Great!

19:26.800 --> 19:29.200
I like the gloves you made for me
very much.

19:36.680 --> 19:40.400
Look at this. Does it look like
the Dengguo in Qingzhou?

19:41.040 --> 19:43.000
It's called Red Fruit in Laowozi Village.

19:43.080 --> 19:44.400
The ones picked early in the morning
are the freshest.

19:47.240 --> 19:48.840
You got up so early these days.

19:48.920 --> 19:50.360
Did you not sleep well at night?

19:50.960 --> 19:53.440
Rise with the sun. Rest at sunset.

19:54.720 --> 19:57.080
I like the life here very much.

19:59.000 --> 20:00.560
After avenging Qingzhou,

20:03.200 --> 20:05.680
I want to continue such a life forever.

20:10.160 --> 20:12.200
What about you?
How did you sleep recently?

20:12.760 --> 20:13.960
Do we need to catch fireflies
for lighting?

20:14.040 --> 20:16.560
No. I had no nightmares these days.

20:17.440 --> 20:18.480
Really?

20:21.480 --> 20:23.320
Mei Lin. Mei Lin.

20:23.920 --> 20:24.960
Big Brother.

20:27.760 --> 20:28.800
Liu.

20:32.240 --> 20:34.120
Well, Mei,

20:35.520 --> 20:38.920
when no one is around,
don't call me Big Brother.

20:39.000 --> 20:39.880
I feel awkward.

20:40.880 --> 20:41.720
Awkward?

20:43.480 --> 20:45.760
- What should I call you then?
- Whatever. You can call me anything.

20:45.840 --> 20:48.240
In all, just don't call me Big Brother.

20:50.960 --> 20:52.800
Mu Rong

20:53.720 --> 20:55.000
Jinghe.

20:57.760 --> 20:59.320
Fine. Just call me by my name.

21:01.280 --> 21:02.120
Murong Jinghe,

21:02.840 --> 21:03.680
I'm off to work.

21:05.120 --> 21:06.400
Are you going to dry Tianjing Grass?

21:06.480 --> 21:07.360
I'll go with you.

21:07.440 --> 21:08.360
I'm feeling much better now.

21:08.440 --> 21:11.160
I can work a bit with you. Let's go.

21:11.240 --> 21:12.800
Miss, Sir,

21:12.880 --> 21:14.280
you don't need to go.

21:14.360 --> 21:15.720
This basket is for Madam Wang.

21:17.000 --> 21:18.080
Thank you, Wei.

21:19.040 --> 21:21.120
Mei, what do you like to eat?

21:21.200 --> 21:22.040
Me?

21:24.320 --> 21:25.560
Mei?

21:26.960 --> 21:29.200
It's the annual Spring Harvest Banquet
of Laowozi Village in a few days.

21:29.280 --> 21:31.680
Each family will prepare a dish.
It'll be very lively.

21:31.760 --> 21:33.200
Mei,

21:33.280 --> 21:34.960
I'll cook whatever you like to eat.

21:35.040 --> 21:36.120
Wei, I…

21:37.520 --> 21:39.120
Mei loves dragon meat.

21:39.760 --> 21:40.600
Dragon?

21:41.360 --> 21:42.600
What is it like?

21:42.680 --> 21:43.520
I've never seen a dragon.

21:43.600 --> 21:46.400
Wei, my brother loves talking nonsense.

21:46.480 --> 21:47.880
Don't listen to him.

21:48.680 --> 21:50.320
I like all kinds of food.
Everything is fine.

21:52.880 --> 21:55.760
Mei is picky about people.

21:55.840 --> 21:57.440
If she doesn't like the man,

21:57.520 --> 21:59.760
whatever he cooks, she won't like it.

22:01.600 --> 22:03.880
What does Brother-in-law mean?

22:03.960 --> 22:05.320
If she dislikes the man,
she won't like the food he makes.

22:05.400 --> 22:08.320
But Mei told me she likes
all kinds of food just now.

22:08.920 --> 22:11.080
Could it be that Mei also likes me?

22:11.760 --> 22:12.760
I got it.

22:13.880 --> 22:14.720
What did you get?

22:17.200 --> 22:18.480
You understood it wrongly.

22:19.200 --> 22:20.080
What's going on with Wei?

22:21.360 --> 22:23.400
There's something wrong with him.
Stay away from him.

22:23.480 --> 22:24.320
There's something wrong
with the way he looks at you.

22:24.400 --> 22:25.480
What's wrong with it?

22:25.560 --> 22:26.600
Where are you going?

22:30.120 --> 22:30.960
I'm going to catch a dragon.

22:51.240 --> 22:52.360
- It smells good.
- Yeah.

22:52.440 --> 22:54.920
My husband never cooks.

22:55.000 --> 22:56.600
This man looks nice.

22:56.680 --> 22:58.080
I heard he can do needlework.

22:58.760 --> 23:00.400
He is very handsome.

23:01.000 --> 23:02.680
Is he married?

23:02.760 --> 23:05.160
My sister-in-law isn't married yet.

23:05.240 --> 23:07.600
- We can ask him later.
- Right.

23:15.520 --> 23:16.840
Sir, please wait.

23:18.120 --> 23:20.080
Erniu's mother says you…

23:20.160 --> 23:21.200
I'm married.

23:21.280 --> 23:22.600
- Married?
- Yes.

23:24.080 --> 23:25.920
You heard it, didn't you?

23:28.000 --> 23:29.200
Madam Wang said

23:29.280 --> 23:32.240
his family suffered a calamity.
I'm afraid his wife was…

23:32.320 --> 23:33.480
My wife is very fine,

23:33.560 --> 23:35.880
and I'll only love her in my lifetime.

23:36.400 --> 23:37.520
Thank you for the kitchen.

23:37.600 --> 23:39.160
This is her favorite snake broth.

23:39.240 --> 23:40.880
I need to send it to her while it's hot.

23:40.960 --> 23:41.800
Well…

23:46.160 --> 23:48.280
His… Is his wife also in the village?

23:48.360 --> 23:50.000
Isn't he here just with his sister?

23:50.920 --> 23:52.160
Sister?

23:56.920 --> 23:57.840
Wei,

24:00.160 --> 24:01.000
these are…

24:02.000 --> 24:02.840
These are all betrothal gifts for you.

24:02.920 --> 24:04.760
I want to marry you.

24:04.840 --> 24:07.040
I can hunt and farm.

24:07.120 --> 24:08.280
I won't let you starve.

24:09.240 --> 24:10.080
Wei,

24:12.360 --> 24:13.920
we are leaving soon.

24:14.000 --> 24:15.240
Where will you be going?

24:15.320 --> 24:17.400
- I'll go…
- Wherever you go, I'll follow you.

24:18.040 --> 24:20.040
Anyway, I'm the only one left
in my family.

24:21.920 --> 24:24.520
Mei Lin, you saved my life before.

24:25.080 --> 24:26.360
I won't let you live a hard life.

24:27.640 --> 24:28.480
Wei,

24:29.120 --> 24:30.720
actually, it was my brother who saved you.

24:30.800 --> 24:33.520
Don't worry. We'll become family
after we get married.

24:33.600 --> 24:35.560
I'll treat my brother-in-law well.

24:35.640 --> 24:37.080
- Actually, I'm married.
- I know.

24:37.680 --> 24:38.800
Madam Wang told me about it.

24:38.880 --> 24:40.040
- Your husband has died.
- He…

24:40.120 --> 24:40.960
Who said I had died?

24:42.360 --> 24:43.240
Brother-in-law?

24:43.320 --> 24:44.520
Who is your brother-in-law?

24:47.400 --> 24:48.560
I'm her husband.

24:55.200 --> 24:56.920
You… Aren't you siblings?

24:57.600 --> 24:58.760
We are not siblings.

24:58.840 --> 25:00.560
We are childhood sweethearts.

25:01.320 --> 25:03.840
During our journey, I made many mistakes

25:04.360 --> 25:05.600
and made my wife angry.

25:06.360 --> 25:07.680
That's why she didn't want

25:07.760 --> 25:09.840
to mention our relationship
in front of others.

25:10.520 --> 25:11.360
Mei,

25:12.000 --> 25:14.160
it's been so long. You should be calm now.

25:15.960 --> 25:17.160
It was my fault

25:18.800 --> 25:20.000
for making Wei misunderstand.

25:20.680 --> 25:21.520
I…

25:23.360 --> 25:24.400
They are a couple.

25:26.680 --> 25:29.080
Madam, it was all my fault.

25:29.160 --> 25:30.040
It's okay.

25:30.920 --> 25:33.520
Well, I have good taste, right?

25:34.520 --> 25:36.240
Just give up.

25:37.200 --> 25:39.240
Stop it. Don't cry.

25:39.320 --> 25:40.760
A real man doesn't need to worry
about getting a wife.

25:45.800 --> 25:46.920
Madam.

25:47.000 --> 25:49.440
All couples quarrel.

25:49.520 --> 25:50.560
By compromising with each other,

25:50.640 --> 25:52.800
you'll stay together
for a lifetime, right?

25:53.920 --> 25:55.720
I think your husband's attitude
is quite nice.

25:55.800 --> 25:57.040
You can forgive him.

25:57.840 --> 25:58.680
Yes.

25:59.680 --> 26:01.640
Actually, I forgave him long ago.

26:04.320 --> 26:05.160
That's good to hear.

26:05.240 --> 26:06.480
That's good to hear.

26:20.120 --> 26:21.640
Come on. Try it.

26:32.400 --> 26:33.720
Didn't you go to catch a dragon?

26:35.080 --> 26:37.800
Your eyes are so poor
that you caught a snake?

26:38.720 --> 26:40.000
The Book of Strange Records mentions

26:40.080 --> 26:41.840
that snakes, originally named Hui,

26:41.920 --> 26:43.360
transform into dragons
after 1,000 years of cultivation.

26:43.440 --> 26:45.480
So, a dragon is essentially a snake,

26:45.560 --> 26:47.200
and dragon meat is snake meat.

26:47.880 --> 26:49.160
Roasted snake meat is more delicious.

26:50.200 --> 26:51.320
You previously hurt
your spleen and stomach.

26:52.120 --> 26:53.240
Meat broth will help with digestion.

26:53.840 --> 26:55.600
You can have roasted snake meat
some other time.

27:01.920 --> 27:04.920
It was my first time cooking.
Let me try it first.

27:18.600 --> 27:19.720
I'm not picky about food.

27:38.880 --> 27:41.840
How is it? Doesn't it taste better
than the dragons in the sky?

27:42.440 --> 27:43.400
It's tasty.

27:45.560 --> 27:46.400
I owe you this.

27:47.000 --> 27:50.480
When we were in the wilderness, I said
as long as we could make it alive,

27:50.560 --> 27:51.680
I would treat you to dragon meat.

27:54.080 --> 27:56.080
Actually, I said Meat Dragon.

27:56.680 --> 27:58.360
The Meat Dragon was made by my mother.

27:59.640 --> 28:01.840
- Meat Dragon?
- It's a type of cooked wheaten food,

28:02.640 --> 28:04.720
a steamed bun with meat in it.

28:05.520 --> 28:08.760
In Qingzhou, every family made
Meat Dragons for joyful occasions.

28:08.840 --> 28:09.880
Haven't you tried it?

28:12.360 --> 28:15.960
I seem to have seen it in a border city
I passed by.

28:16.560 --> 28:18.080
They call them meat buns.

28:18.920 --> 28:21.560
How about we make Meat Dragons
for the Spring Harvest Banquet?

28:22.440 --> 28:23.280
I'll take a try then.

28:23.920 --> 28:24.760
I think I can make them.

28:25.360 --> 28:26.280
As long as they are cooked.

28:26.360 --> 28:28.200
As a couple, we can't just eat for free.

28:28.280 --> 28:30.320
We should at least prepare something.

28:54.960 --> 28:56.160
Since you are a couple,

28:56.880 --> 28:58.240
don't sleep on separate beds.

28:58.880 --> 28:59.720
Madam.

28:59.800 --> 29:01.000
Madam Wang.

29:01.800 --> 29:03.880
We'll sleep separately.
It'll be more spacious.

29:03.960 --> 29:05.880
How can you say that?

29:05.960 --> 29:06.880
Couples have arguments,

29:06.960 --> 29:09.200
but they make up quickly.

29:09.880 --> 29:12.480
If you keep sleeping separately,

29:12.560 --> 29:13.480
your feelings will fade.

29:15.360 --> 29:16.560
Why are you smiling?

29:16.640 --> 29:18.360
If you offend your wife again,

29:18.440 --> 29:19.800
I can't help you anymore.

29:20.680 --> 29:22.120
Yes. I'll be obedient.

29:22.200 --> 29:23.680
I'll listen to you and my wife.

29:24.520 --> 29:25.760
That's more like it.

29:28.120 --> 29:29.040
Take care, Madam.

29:33.520 --> 29:35.480
We need to listen to Madam Wang.

29:42.840 --> 29:44.240
We've slept on the same bed anyway.

30:10.080 --> 30:12.560
Are you asleep?

30:17.880 --> 30:19.160
Rest at sunset.

30:19.800 --> 30:20.880
She should be asleep.

30:27.280 --> 30:30.000
You can't fall asleep?

30:40.040 --> 30:42.600
If you can't fall asleep either,

30:43.880 --> 30:45.200
I can talk with you.

30:48.120 --> 30:48.960
I…

30:52.800 --> 30:53.640
I…

30:55.840 --> 30:57.240
I have nothing to say.

31:00.600 --> 31:01.440
Sleep then.

31:06.200 --> 31:08.760
Actually, I'm also quite sleepy.

31:34.160 --> 31:35.000
There is a mosquito.

31:39.360 --> 31:41.840
It's dead. We can sleep now.

31:59.320 --> 32:00.360
I hope such days

32:01.440 --> 32:03.080
can last forever.

32:10.400 --> 32:15.160
YANMING PALACE

32:20.280 --> 32:22.200
We've searched for such a long time.

32:22.960 --> 32:25.400
How could there be no traces?

32:48.240 --> 32:50.520
Your Majesty, here is the tea I just made.

32:51.200 --> 32:52.360
Please try it.

33:01.200 --> 33:02.040
Sit.

33:04.760 --> 33:05.600
Let me see.

33:09.080 --> 33:11.080
Fortunately, the burn that day

33:11.880 --> 33:12.880
did not leave a scar.

33:13.920 --> 33:16.280
The burn ointment bestowed
by Your Majesty is very effective.

33:17.080 --> 33:19.000
Thank you, Your Majesty.

33:21.320 --> 33:23.680
Concubine Yan, you are afraid of me?

33:26.440 --> 33:27.760
No.

33:27.840 --> 33:30.920
Your Majesty, you are a benevolent ruler
and have been very nice to me.

33:31.000 --> 33:31.840
I'm not afraid.

34:01.280 --> 34:04.720
I don't remember
you were skilled in these things.

34:10.120 --> 34:12.239
Is the tea I made not good?

34:12.880 --> 34:14.120
I'll make another pot.

34:14.199 --> 34:15.159
No.

34:15.760 --> 34:16.760
You did it very well.

34:17.480 --> 34:19.679
I'm just not used to it.

34:23.520 --> 34:25.120
Thank you for your praise, Your Majesty.

34:25.199 --> 34:27.960
There is a lot I need to learn.

34:29.679 --> 34:32.120
Maybe I scared her that day.

34:40.520 --> 34:42.239
Concubine Yan, take a look.

34:44.960 --> 34:46.920
- I don't dare.
- I allow you to read it.

34:51.639 --> 34:52.480
Look.

34:57.720 --> 34:58.720
The Prince Heir?

35:02.400 --> 35:04.200
My brother has become
the Prince Heir of Xiyan.

35:08.160 --> 35:09.920
I thank Your Majesty
on behalf of my brother.

35:11.720 --> 35:12.640
I know

35:12.720 --> 35:14.320
my brother relied
on Your Majesty's support

35:14.400 --> 35:15.640
to become the Prince Heir of Xiyan.

35:15.720 --> 35:18.240
It's because your brother
has the capability.

35:18.320 --> 35:20.480
I merely took pleasure in his success.

35:22.800 --> 35:25.000
From now on, there will be
someone backing you up.

35:25.080 --> 35:27.400
So, don't be afraid of me.

35:30.320 --> 35:32.560
I'm never afraid of Your Majesty.

35:35.960 --> 35:38.280
I don't need you to serve me here.

35:38.920 --> 35:39.760
It's late at night.

35:40.280 --> 35:42.320
Go back to Fanghua Palace and rest.

35:44.120 --> 35:44.960
Yes, Your Majesty.

35:55.320 --> 35:56.560
Don't you think

35:57.880 --> 36:00.120
she is acting more and more properly
as a concubine of Great Yan?

36:01.000 --> 36:02.680
Concubine Yan is smart.

36:02.760 --> 36:05.240
She learned the rules very fast.

36:05.320 --> 36:09.000
Today, I heard the Noble Consort

36:09.080 --> 36:11.840
praising her for being sensible
and courteous.

36:12.960 --> 36:14.800
I just don't want to see her

36:15.720 --> 36:16.960
being so well-behaved.

36:19.880 --> 36:21.880
Send a letter of congratulations
to the Prince Heir of Xiyan.

36:22.760 --> 36:23.880
Sure enough,

36:25.040 --> 36:26.280
he didn't disappoint me.

36:26.800 --> 36:27.800
Yes, Your Majesty.

36:49.400 --> 36:50.440
Your Highness,

36:50.520 --> 36:52.400
you're the reincarnation
of the Sun Kunlun.

36:53.000 --> 36:54.280
So, the Princess Heir

36:54.360 --> 36:56.240
should be the reincarnation
of the Moon Kunlun.

36:57.200 --> 36:58.760
The union of the Sun Kunlun
and Moon Kunlun

36:58.840 --> 37:01.200
brings the harmony of Yin and Yang,
ensuring favorable weather.

37:01.920 --> 37:03.000
It will surely bless Xiyan

37:03.080 --> 37:04.560
with everlasting prosperity.

37:07.520 --> 37:09.480
As long as the Sun Kunlun
and Moon Kunlun unite,

37:09.560 --> 37:12.080
Your Majesty will surely enjoy
a prolonged life.

37:13.200 --> 37:16.000
Heaven begins with one.
Earth completes with six.

37:16.680 --> 37:19.760
Once one and six unite,
all origins become clear.

37:19.840 --> 37:22.160
May this be the guiding principle
and ultimate source of life.

37:22.240 --> 37:23.880
Please, heavenly deities,

37:23.960 --> 37:25.840
guide us to find the Moon Kunlun now.

37:27.200 --> 37:28.520
How is it?

37:31.840 --> 37:34.480
Found her. Your Majesty, I've found her.

37:35.360 --> 37:36.840
The sacred woman reincarnated
from the Moon Kunlun

37:36.920 --> 37:38.440
is in Zhaojing of the Yan Dynasty.

37:40.040 --> 37:42.040
The Princess Heir is from Great Yan?

37:43.040 --> 37:43.960
Father,

37:44.040 --> 37:45.280
the Sun Kunlun and Moon Kunlun

37:45.360 --> 37:47.240
are the divine envoys
of the Xiyan heavenly deities.

37:47.920 --> 37:49.160
Now that the sacred woman
is the Moon Kunlun,

37:49.240 --> 37:50.720
she must be from Xiyan.

37:50.800 --> 37:53.640
I suppose she is just temporarily
residing in the Yan Dynasty.

37:57.960 --> 38:00.840
Your Highness, you have a point.

38:00.920 --> 38:03.000
Send our men to search
for her immediately.

38:03.080 --> 38:05.320
Make sure to find the sacred woman

38:05.400 --> 38:06.680
and bring her back to Xiyan.

38:07.440 --> 38:09.280
Father, I request to speak.

38:09.360 --> 38:11.480
I've been in the Yan Dynasty
for several years,

38:12.080 --> 38:14.640
and I'm quite familiar with Zhaojing.

38:14.720 --> 38:16.600
If I am to search for the sacred woman,

38:16.680 --> 38:17.840
success is assured.

38:18.640 --> 38:19.600
You can't.

38:20.320 --> 38:21.920
You are the Prince Heir.

38:22.000 --> 38:24.560
Why should you go to the Yan Dynasty?

38:24.640 --> 38:26.360
This is something confidential.

38:26.440 --> 38:28.080
You can't tell it to anyone.

38:28.680 --> 38:30.360
Father, coincidentally,

38:33.080 --> 38:34.520
I've received
the letter of congratulations

38:34.600 --> 38:35.920
sent by the Emperor of the Yan Dynasty.

38:36.520 --> 38:39.080
He invites me to discuss border trade.

38:39.600 --> 38:42.880
Isn't this a great opportunity
given by the heaven deities?

38:45.800 --> 38:47.160
God bless Xiyan.

38:53.760 --> 38:55.320
LETTER OF CONGRATULATIONS FROM GREAT YAN

39:00.880 --> 39:02.000
Alright.

39:02.080 --> 39:04.160
Since this is about your Princess Heir,

39:04.840 --> 39:08.240
you'll find her in person.

39:09.280 --> 39:10.600
Yes, Father.

39:24.920 --> 39:26.320
Your Highness, you are wise.

39:27.200 --> 39:28.560
How were you sure

39:28.640 --> 39:29.520
His Majesty

39:29.600 --> 39:31.840
would believe in the reincarnation
of the Sun and Moon divine envoys?

39:32.880 --> 39:34.800
Who among those at the pinnacle of power

39:35.600 --> 39:37.720
does not yearn for immortality?

39:39.600 --> 39:42.320
But you don't believe in immortality,
Your Highness.

39:44.720 --> 39:45.800
Immortality.

39:47.120 --> 39:48.800
Immortality is good.

39:49.920 --> 39:53.800
Immortality would eliminate the regret
of unfulfilled ambitions

39:53.880 --> 39:56.240
and dispel the ignorance
of overreached attempts.

39:56.320 --> 39:58.760
Even as the seas turn
and the earth changes,

39:58.840 --> 40:00.520
deep emotions are not bound
by shallow fates.

40:02.200 --> 40:03.520
How wonderful it would be!

40:05.520 --> 40:08.120
Mei Lin, my Princess Heir,

40:08.760 --> 40:09.960
wait for me to go back.
